-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="how-much-is-it-to-post-to-north-america?" class="section-wrapper information-table" index="2" data-v-d2116e83 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="information-table__title" data-v-d2116e83>How much is it to post to North America?</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-d2116e83>The price of postage to North America depends on the weight and destination of your parcel.

Check out our table below on how much it is to send a parcel to some of our most popular North American destinations.</p><div class="information-table__wrap" data-v-d2116e83><table class="information-table__element" data-v-d2116e83><thead class="information-table__table-header" data-v-d2116e83><tr data-v-d2116e83><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Destination</th><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</th><!----></tr></thead><tbody data-v-d2116e83><!--[--><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Destination</span><span data-v-d2116e83>USA</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£10.89</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Destination</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Canada</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£12.99</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Destination</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Mexico</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£12.99</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Destination</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Cayman Islands</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£20.49</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Destination</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Costa Rica</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£20.09</span></td><!----></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="information-table__table-footer" data-v-d2116e83><small data-v-d2116e83>Table prices quoted are for a ParcelShop Standard delivery of a 250g parcel. Quoted on 06/05/2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.</small></p><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-d2116e83><!----></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="a-side-view-profile-of-a-customer-sitting-on-a-sofa,-with-a-laptop-resting-on-their-lap-as-they-look-down-at-the-screen." class="photo-container" index="3" data-v-b709af2f><picture data-v-b709af2f><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681bad2.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C3257%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C3257%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C3257%2C8192%2C1911&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A side-view profile of a customer sitting on a sofa, with a laptop resting on their lap as they look down at the screen." width="1200" height="280" class="photo-block" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-b709af2f></picture></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="4" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="how-to-send-a-parcel-to-north-america" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>How to send a parcel to North America</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>When sending to North America, you’ll be asked for more information about your parcel to help speed up your customs process. We collect all the information required during your online booking, making it easy and stress-free. 

Shipping to North America from the UK is simple with Evri, just follow our three easy steps:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>1</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Book your parcel delivery</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Visit our website and choose to drop off your parcel or arrange a collection from your home or office. You can also book with us in person at selected Post Office ParcelShops.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>2</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Print your label</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Print your postage label at home or at a local ParcelShop using our free Print in ParcelShop devices.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>3</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Drop off your parcel or wait for its collection</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Choose from 10,000+ locations near you to drop off your parcel at a  ParcelShop or Evri Locker. If you&#39;ve booked a courier collection service, we&#39;ll give you a 1-hour window on the day for when we&#39;ll collect your package.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="shipping-to-north-america-with-evri" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Shipping to North America with Evri<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;ve made it easy to send parcels abroad with three simple options for you to choose from:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_28638a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book your delivery online and choose from 9,000+ locations to drop off your package. Simply hand your parcel to the shop assistant, and we&#39;ll take it from there. You can also book in-store at one of our Post Office ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-ParcelShops-open ParcelShops page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->ParcelShops<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_30588a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have convenient and secure Lockers located across the UK, with most available 24/7. Book online and visit your nearest Locker. Scan your barcode, place your parcel in an available space, and we’ll collect it ready for delivery.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Lockers-open Lockers page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/lockers" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Lockers<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrGpbqstJ9-Wcz_EVRI_LOCATION_04_47188a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrGpbqstJ9-Wcz_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4718.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrGpbqstJ9-Wcz_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4718.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XrGpbqstJ9-Wcz_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4718.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, holding their parcels and smiling. The courier can be seen facing towards the customer in a friendly conversation." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Couriers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our couriers also provide a door-to-door collection service. Simply go online and choose a convenient day and location - whether at home or the office. We&#39;ll give you a one-hour collection window.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Courier services-open Courier services page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Courier services<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="where-does-evri-deliver-in-north-america?" class="section-wrapper" index="6" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Where does Evri deliver in North America?</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From sending to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/new-york" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->New York City<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and every state in the USA to the smaller islands of St. Kitts and Nevis, Evri delivers across North America. Our network covers more than 200+ countries and territories, and six continents, to make sending parcels internationally as easy for you as possible.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->See our helpful guides for sending packages to some of our most popular destinations in North America. Whether you’re planning to post in time for a national holiday or you need tips on address formats and what you can send, find everything you need here:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/usa" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->United States<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/canada" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Canada<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/mexico" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Mexico<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-mod