rect=0%2C3257%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS",{"x":55,"y":153,"zoom":56,"background":57},3257,{"dimensions":155,"alt":149,"copyright":35,"url":158,"id":151,"edit":159},{"width":156,"height":157},343,160,"north-america.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=766%2C2407%2C6554%2C3057&w=343&h=160",{"x":160,"y":161,"zoom":162,"background":57},766,2407,1.25,{"dimensions":164,"alt":149,"copyright":35,"url":167,"id":151,"edit":168},{"width":165,"height":166},704,240,"north-america.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2671%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":55,"y":169,"zoom":56,"background":57},2671,"photo_block$26dbd7c0-ec98-4b6f-87d6-1f3887c536e7","photo_block",{"variation":173,"version":31,"items":174,"primary":194,"id":198,"slice_type":199,"slice_label":35},"listNoIcon",[175,182,188],{"title":176,"content":177,"isNumbered":181},"Book your parcel delivery",[178],{"type":76,"text":179,"spans":180,"direction":79},"Visit our website and choose to drop off your parcel or arrange a collection from your home or office. You can also book with us in person at selected Post Office ParcelShops.",[],true,{"title":183,"content":184,"isNumbered":181},"Print your label",[185],{"type":76,"text":186,"spans":187,"direction":79},"Print your postage label at home or at a local ParcelShop using our free Print in ParcelShop devices.",[],{"title":189,"content":190,"isNumbered":181},"Drop off your parcel or wait for its collection",[191],{"type":76,"text":192,"spans":193,"direction":79},"Choose from 10,000+ locations near you to drop off your parcel at a  ParcelShop or Evri Locker. If you've booked a courier collection service, we'll give you a 1-hour window on the day for when we'll collect your package.",[],{"theme":195,"title":196,"description":197,"showPaddingTop":20},"standard","How to send a parcel to North America","When sending to North America, you’ll be asked for more information about your parcel to help speed up your customs process. We collect all the information required during your online booking, making it easy and stress-free. \n\nShipping to North America from the UK is simple with Evri, just follow our three easy steps:","list_block$cdd5df18-3916-4ff5-9a6d-bc493324fd30","list_block",{"variation":201,"version":31,"items":202,"primary":263,"id":273,"slice_type":274,"slice_label":35},"3Column",[203,224,243],{"Title":204,"Description":209,"Image":213,"Label":35,"UrlText":207,"Url":219,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":222,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[205],{"type":206,"text":207,"spans":208},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[210],{"type":76,"text":211,"spans":212,"direction":79},"Book your delivery online and choose from 9,000+ locations to drop off your package. Simply hand your parcel to the shop assistant, and we'll take it from there. You can also book in-store at one of our Post Office ParcelShops",[],{"dimensions":214,"alt":215,"copyright":35,"url":216,"id":217,"edit":218},{"width":67,"height":68},"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"link_type":88,"key":220,"url":221},"416570b3-3bc2-4b8d-9db4-41c8ccd525c6","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":223},"Any",{"Title":225,"Description":229,"Image":233,"Label":35,"UrlText":227,"Url":239,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":242,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[226],{"type":206,"text":227,"spans":228},"Lockers",[],[230],{"type":76,"text":231,"spans":232,"direction":79},"We have convenient and secure Lockers located across the UK, with most available 24\u002F7. Book online and visit your nearest Locker. Scan your barcode, place your parcel in an available space, and we’ll collect it ready for delivery.",[],{"dimensions":234,"alt":235,"copyright":35,"url":236,"id":237,"edit":238},{"width":67,"height":68},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"link_type":88,"key":240,"url":241},"9d29caa9-eafc-47bf-aa58-76ca50a8998b","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":223},{"Title":244,"Description":248,"Image":252,"Label":35,"UrlText":258,"Url":259,"buttonDataGtmTrack":35,"SecondaryButtonText":35,"SecondaryButtonUrl":262,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":35,"ShowAppDownloadCta":35},[245],{"type":206,"text":246,"spans":247},"Couriers",[],[249],{"type":76,"text":250,"spans":251,"direction":79},"Our couriers also provide a door-to-door collection service. Simply go online and choose a convenient day and location - whether at home or the office. We'll give you a one-hour collection window.",[],{"dimensions":253,"alt":254,"copyright":35,"url":255,"id":256,"edit":257},{"width":67,"height":68},"A customer is standing in the doorway of their home, holding their parcels and smiling. The courier can be seen facing towards the customer in a friendly conversation.","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XrGpbqstJ9-Wcz_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4718.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XrGpbqstJ9-Wcz",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},"Courier services",{"link_type":88,"key":260,"url":261},"43534935-7d70-43fb-b5d4-04209c0b213b","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":223},{"SectionTitle":264,"SectionDescription":269,"theme":35},[265],{"type":266,"text":267,"spans":268},"heading2","Shipping to North America with Evri",[],[270],{"type":76,"text":271,"spans":272},"We've made it easy to send parcels abroad with three simple options for you to choose from:",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":276,"version":31,"items":277,"primary":279,"id":317,"slice_type":116,"slice_label":35},"cardNoImageWithCta",[278],{},{"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":280,"CardText":281,"ButtonText":111,"ButtonUrl":315,"IsEco":20},"Where does Evri deliver in North America?",[282,291,294,302,309],{"type":76,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":79},"From sending to New York City and every state in the USA to the smaller islands of St. Kitts and Nevis, Evri delivers across North America. Our network covers more than 200+ countries and territories, and six continents, to make sending parcels internationally as easy for you as possible.",[285,290],{"start":286,"end":287,"type":86,"data":288},16,29,{"link_type":88,"url":289,"target":90},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fnew-york",{"start":286,"end":287,"type":92},{"type":76,"text":292,"spans":293,"direction":79},"See our helpful guides for sending packages to some of our most popular destinations in North America. Whether you’re planning to post in time for a national holiday or you need tips on address formats and what you can send, find everything you need here:",[],{"type":295,"text":296,"spans":297,"direction":79},"list-item","United States",[298,301],{"start":55,"end":299,"type":86,"data":300},13,{"link_type":88,"url":89,"target":90},{"start":55,"end":299,"type":92},{"type":295,"text":303,"spans":304,"direction":79},"Canada ",[305,308],{"start":55,"end":306,"type":86,"data":307},6,{"link_type":88,"url":97,"target":90},{"start":55,"end":306,"type":92},{"type":295,"text":126,"spans":310,"direction":79},[311,314],{"start":55,"end":306,"type":86,"data":312},{"link_type":88,"url":313,"target":90},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fmexico",{"start":55,"end":306,"type":92},{"link_type":88,"key":316,"url":114},"a52e9764-53ee-4163-9699-94e2db1de6f3","card$49c696ff-412f-4067-bfb4-7291d135aa40",{"variation":61,"version":31,"items":319,"primary":321,"id":335,"slice_type":116,"slice_label":35},[320],{},{"CardImage":322,"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":328,"CardText":329,"ButtonText":111,"ButtonUrl":333,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":323,"alt":324,"copyright":35,"url":325,"id":326,"edit":327},{"width":67,"height":68},"A customer is outside their home and sitting in their wheelchair, smiling for the photo with a parcel on their lap.","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XpvpbqstJ9-Wbk_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0852.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XpvpbqstJ9-Wbk",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},"How long will my parcel take to be delivered to North America?",[330],{"type":76,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":79},"Our delivery time for parcels to North America is 7-23 working days, depending on your destination.",[],{"link_type":88,"key":334,"url":114},"36aa3db7-6aa8-4644-b60d-68c72dbc68c5","card$93d4bb75-307c-477d-b60c-f6458e923fd2",{"variation":276,"version":31,"items":337,"primary":339,"id":364,"slice_type":116,"slice_label":35},[338],{},{"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":340,"CardText":341,"ButtonText":361,"ButtonUrl":362,"IsEco":20},"Sending multiple parcels to North America",[342,351,355,358],{"type":76,"text":343,"spans":344,"direction":79},"Whether you're handling a number of overseas orders or you're an international business, our bulk integration tool helps make the process easy for you. Send multiple parcels quickly at once:",[345,350],{"start":346,"end":347,"type":86,"data":348},93,109,{"link_type":88,"url":349,"target":90},"north-america.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload",{"start":346,"end":347,"type":92},{"type":352,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":79},"o-list-item","Connect your seller accounts like eBay, Etsy, Amazon and Shopify to your Evri account and click 'Link Account', or upload parcels via a CSV file",[],{"type":352,"text":356,"spans":357,"direction":79},"Package and weight your items, book your delivery, and print postage labels at home or in-store using our Print in ParcelShop devices",[],{"type":352,"text":359,"spans":360,"direction":79},"Send your parcels through our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers or book a convenient courier collection day",[],"View integrations",{"link_type":88,"key":363,"url":349},"bbd14529-5770-4c1f-8c9a-9dd4f42bcde0","card$dffdce3c-d664-4817-b794-7eb0a596bd9d",{"variation":366,"version":31,"items":367,"primary":448,"id":451,"slice_type":199,"slice_label":35},"listComponent",[368,387,399,411,424,436],{"title":369,"content":370,"icon":380},"Regular tracking updates",[371],{"type":76,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":79},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[374,379],{"start":375,"end":376,"type":86,"data":377},55,63,{"link_type":88,"url":378,"target":90},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":375,"end":376,"type":92},{"dimensions":381,"alt":383,"copyright":35,"url":384,"id":385,"edit":386},{"width":382,"height":382},40,"Phone icon","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":388,"content":389,"icon":393},"Parcel cover",[390],{"type":76,"text":391,"spans":392,"direction":79},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":394,"alt":395,"copyright":35,"url":396,"id":397,"edit":398},{"width":382,"height":382},"Money icon","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":400,"content":401,"icon":405},"Customs made easier",[402],{"type":76,"text":403,"spans":404,"direction":79},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":406,"alt":407,"copyright":35,"url":408,"id":409,"edit":410},{"width":382,"height":382},"Passport icon","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":412,"content":413,"icon":417},"Flexible printing options",[414],{"type":76,"text":415,"spans":416,"direction":79},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":418,"alt":419,"copyright":35,"url":420,"id":421,"edit":422},{"width":382,"height":382},"Printer icon","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":423},"#fff",{"title":425,"content":426,"icon":430},"Bulk send",[427],{"type":76,"text":428,"spans":429,"direction":79},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":431,"alt":432,"copyright":35,"url":433,"id":434,"edit":435},{"width":382,"height":382},"Laptop icon","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"title":437,"content":438,"icon":442},"Trusted by top UK brands",[439],{"type":76,"text":440,"spans":441,"direction":79},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":443,"alt":444,"copyright":35,"url":445,"id":446,"edit":447},{"width":382,"height":382},"Success icon","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},{"theme":195,"title":449,"description":450},"Why send parcels to North America with Evri?","Our international services include all the following benefits:","list_block$5561303f-d955-4b8d-a3c8-2302fd07d450",{"variation":453,"version":31,"items":454,"primary":456,"id":480,"slice_type":116,"slice_label":35},"cardWithImageNoCta",[455],{},{"CardImage":457,"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":463,"CardText":464,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":458,"alt":459,"copyright":35,"url":460,"id":461,"edit":462},{"width":67,"height":68},"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","north-america.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":55,"y":55,"zoom":56,"background":57},"Posting to North America is easy with Evri",[465,468,471],{"type":76,"text":466,"spans":467,"direction":79},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":76,"text":469,"spans":470,"direction":79},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":76,"text":472,"spans":473,"direction":79},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[474,479],{"start":475,"end":476,"type":86,"data":477},30,65,{"link_type":88,"url":478,"target":90},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":475,